# P11: the three controls it names, each exercised the way its own bug needs.
#
# #82 is about two sliders clamping each other, and a clamp only shows up when
# one is dragged past the other. The minimum slider sits at the far left and the
# maximum at the far right, so the drag below takes the minimum most of the way
# across; "writes: min N, max M" counts how many times each wrote back, which is
# the number that distinguishes a clamp from a fight between two of them.
#
# #485 is about which way the scrollbar runs, so the wheel is turned inside the
# forty-row list rather than anywhere else in the window.
#
# #473 is about the compact DatePicker's size, and the stepper is what changes a
# compact picker's value without opening a calendar -- which would be another
# window, and so out of reach here for the same reason P19's menu is.
#
# P11：它所指名的三個控制項，各以其對應缺陷所需的方式操作。
#
# #82 談的是兩個滑桿互相箝制，而箝制只有在其中一個被拖過另一個時才會顯現。minimum 滑桿位於最左端、
# maximum 位於最右端，因此下方的拖曳會把 minimum 拖過大半個行程；「writes: min N, max M」計算
# 各自回寫了幾次，而那正是能區分「一次箝制」與「兩者互相拉扯」的數字。
#
# #485 談的是捲軸的方向，因此滾輪是在那四十列的清單之內轉動，而非視窗中的其他任何位置。
#
# #473 談的是精簡型 DatePicker 的尺寸，而 stepper 正是「不開啟日曆就能改變精簡型 picker 數值」的
# 控制項——開啟日曆會是另一個視窗，因此與 P19 的選單同樣在此不可及。
#
# origin=frame. Window 760x648 points, capture 1520px wide -- scale 2.
# origin=frame。視窗 760x648 點，擷取寬 1520px——scale 2。
# **Re-measured 2026-09-28 from p11-macos-final-20260928-084628.png (760 x 648, the
# window frame).** The rows had been about 22 points above their controls: Reset,
# Separate and Collide were clicked at y 307 with the buttons at 329, the knob was
# grabbed at 255 with the minimum slider at 276, and the capture still read
# "minimum 0 / maximum 41" -- nothing but the list scroll and one stepper click had
# landed. The stepper rows now go up, up, down so the date ends one month on from
# launch; the old up-then-down ended on the launch date, which a run where both
# clicks missed also shows.
# **2026-09-28 依 p11-macos-final-20260928-084628.png(760 x 648,視窗外框)重新量測。**各列原本比控制項
# 高了約 22 點:Reset、Separate、Collide 點在 y 307,按鈕卻在 329;旋鈕抓在 255,最小值滑桿卻在 276;擷圖
# 仍讀到 "minimum 0 / maximum 41"——除了清單捲動與一次步進器點擊,沒有一下命中。步進器改為上、上、下,讓日期
# 停在啟動後一個月;舊的「上再下」停在啟動日期,而兩下都落空的一次也會是那樣。
click,86,329,frame,left,,,Reset counters -- writes must go to min 0 max 0,macos
sleep,,,,,,600000,,macos
